= Ruth Fischer

Born Elfriede Eisler in Leipzig, a founder of the Austrian party, now the fiery leader of the Berlin organisation. She speaks for the impatient young workers of the capital, and she has nothing but scorn for what she calls the opportunism of the Zentrale. [? if c_lead = 2 : Now the Zentrale is hers. ?]

- @berlin
- @opportunism
- @root: Return to main

@berlin
title: Rouse the Berlin District
subtitle: Berlin grows and grows angrier. The Left's hold on the capital tightens.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.district_berlin_members *= 1.05;
if (Q.district_berlin_faction == 'offensive') {
    Q.district_berlin_loyalty += (Q.leading_faction == 'offensive') ? 10 : -4;
}
Q.militancy += 5;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 6;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

Fischer speaks at the AEG gates, at the Neukölln labour exchange, at every district meeting. Berlin's young communists would follow her anywhere.

@opportunism
title: [? if c_lead = 2 : Purge the Opportunists ?][? if c_lead != 2 : Attack the Opportunists ?]
subtitle: [? if c_lead = 2 : The Right's officials are removed. The Left is delighted; the party is shaken. ?][? if c_lead != 2 : Fischer attacks the Zentrale's line openly. The Left rallies to her. ?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : Next advisor action in 1 month. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : Next advisor action in [+ advisor_action_timer +] months. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 5;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
if (Q.leading_faction == 'offensive') {
    Q.unionist_satisfaction -= 10;
    Q.offensive_satisfaction += 6;
    Q.unity -= 4;
    for (var d of Q.districts) {
        if (Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] == 'unionist') {
            Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] -= 5;
        }
    }
} else {
    Q.offensive_satisfaction += 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 8;
    Q.unity -= 4;
}
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

The trade union bureaucrats in our own ranks, Fischer says, are the SPD's fifth column inside the party. The hall rises to its feet. Half of it, anyway.
